traces the inherited flags of every Q1 and Q4 decision through the records’ references. Q2 and Q3
statements are descriptive; the cells they use carry the flags listed in the report. Table 17 sets the
Q1 estimates beside their re-evaluation with the registered configurations, and Table 18 compares
the Q4 estimates, calibrated lower bounds, and decisions under both configurations and gives the
adjusted market p-value under the registered configuration; the largest Q4 change is on fresh4,
where the gain difference moves from 0.183 to 0.176, still above the registered 0.10.

