    15	  it requires and those that are flagged, and the status under three readings. The original `scoring.json` is
    16	  byte-identical to the round-7 file. Four tests pin the map (they failed before the code).
    17	- **One reading wider than yours.** Applied to every descriptive prediction, the same rule also reaches Q1-c (the
    18	  efficiency difference uses the flagged D2+H3 searches on fresh0, fresh1, fresh3 and fresh4) and Q2-a to Q2-c (the pooled
    19	  factorial contrasts include R3's flagged D2+H3 searches on fresh1 and fresh4). Q2-d still fails on its unflagged X7-SC
